@startuml
' Level 3 - "Send $500 to my landlord": the agent proposes, only the customer's fresh MFA sign-in executes.
' Render: plantuml-new -tpng 03-transfer.puml
'   1-3 Gateway (JWT, interceptor incl. revocation check, Cedar: scope propose and <= $1,000), then the
'       tools Lambda writes a PENDING proposal as agentic-bank-app-proposer (PutItem, proposal fields only).
'   4   The bank app signs in fresh: password + TOTP with the public `app` client.
'   5-6 API Gateway's JWT authorizer accepts only `app` tokens (the agent's get 401). The handler checks
'       auth_time <= 300 s and that stored == recomputed == sent request_hash.
'   7-8 One TransactWriteItems as agentic-bank-app-approver: PENDING -> EXECUTED, debit, ledger row.
'       A replay or second concurrent approval fails condition 1: 409, no money moves.
hide footbox
skinparam ArrowColor #545B64
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C9CED6
autonumber

participant "Agent" as A
participant "MCP gateway" as G
participant "Tools Lambda" as T
participant "Bank app (CLI)" as P
participant "Approvals API" as H
participant "DynamoDB" as D

A -> G : propose_transfer + token
G -> T : allowed (scope, amount)
T -> D : Put XFER PENDING
P -> P : sign in: password + TOTP
P -> H : approve + request_hash
H -> H : fresh? hash matches?
H -> D : one transaction
D --> H : executed (exactly once)
H --> P : EXECUTED
@enduml
